From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Noite <noite@noite.now>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 22:22:29 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] node:crypto: scrypt and scryptSync

Void's auth (better-auth) hashes passwords with node:crypto scrypt, which celld stubbed as notImplemented, so email/password sign-up threw ERR_METHOD_NOT_IMPLEMENTED. Implement both forms over the scrypt crate (already in the build via pkcs5) with Node's parameters, defaults, and error codes.
